Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.02,Default,,0,0,0,,People come here for many reasons.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.76,0:00:10.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Some visit me just to know if fate will smile on them.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.30,0:00:15.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Others come for far more serious reasons.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.34,0:00:19.64,Default,,0,0,0,,They want a journey into the subconscious.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.08,0:00:23.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Very few leave here without some insight.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.46,0:00:28.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, I thought so.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.00,0:00:37.04,Default,,0,0,0,,You have a great fear that's hard to overcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.40,0:00:40.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Perhaps you can come back later.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.96,0:00:43.48,Default,,0,0,0,,My door is always open to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.94,0:00:46.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Come back when you're ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.00,0:00:50.08,Default,,0,0,0,,May I give you some advice?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.30,0:00:56.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I see a priest.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.02,0:00:59.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Try to meet him.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.00,0:01:01.48,Default,,0,0,0,,He can help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.38,0:01:04.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I have nothing more to tell.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.62,0:01:08.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Go with love and an open mind.
